  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "这些路走不走得通，要看事发后的前 6 小时。",
   "spoken": "这些路走不走得通，要看事发后的前 6 小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.15
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "发现异常，先暂停，协议暂停，交易所暂停这条链的提币。",
   "spoken": "发现异常，先暂停，协议暂停，交易所暂停这条链的提币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.212,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 6.31,
   "speechEnd": 11.512
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "接着整理地址清单，被盗地址，攻击者地址，已知的下一跳。",
   "spoken": "接着整理地址清单，被盗地址，攻击者地址，已知的下一跳。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.576,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 12.674,
   "speechEnd": 17.769
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "清单是所有通知的前提，清单不准，冻结请求就会被拒绝或延误。",
   "spoken": "清单是所有通知的前提，清单不准，冻结请求就会被拒绝或延误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.82,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 18.918,
   "speechEnd": 24.299
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "然后并行通知，不是排队通知。",
   "spoken": "然后并行通知，不是排队通知。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 25.352,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 25.45,
   "speechEnd": 27.771
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "稳定币发行方、交易所风控、跨链桥和兑换服务、SEAL 911 这样的应急网络、链上分析公司，同时发出去。",
   "spoken": "稳定币发行方、交易所风控、跨链桥和兑换服务、SEAL 911 这样的应急网络、链上分析公司，同时发出去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.836,
   "dur": 9.48,
   "speechStart": 28.934,
   "speechEnd": 37.481
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "先发清单，不要等完整报告，冻结只需要准确的地址和交易哈希。",
   "spoken": "先发清单，不要等完整报告，冻结只需要准确的地址和交易哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.536,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 38.634,
   "speechEnd": 43.681
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "同时做证据保全，交易哈希、日志、服务器镜像。",
   "spoken": "同时做证据保全，交易哈希、日志、服务器镜像。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 44.732,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 44.83,
   "speechEnd": 49.187
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "保全要在清理和恢复系统之前完成，恢复会覆盖证据。",
   "spoken": "保全要在清理和恢复系统之前完成，恢复会覆盖证据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 50.256,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 50.354,
   "speechEnd": 55.092
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "然后报警，按辖区通知监管。",
   "spoken": "然后报警，按辖区通知监管。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 56.164,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 56.262,
   "speechEnd": 58.643
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "一小时之后，可以在链上喊话，提出赏金和安全港条件，并且每小时更新地址清单。",
   "spoken": "一小时之后，可以在链上喊话，提出赏金和安全港条件，并且每小时更新地址清单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 59.696,
   "dur": 7.584,
   "speechStart": 59.794,
   "speechEnd": 66.448
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "安全港要事先写好。",
   "spoken": "安全港要事先写好。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 67.5,
   "dur": 2.616,
   "speechStart": 67.598,
   "speechEnd": 69.264
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "SEAL 的白帽安全港框架，让协议通过治理事先授权白帽，在攻击正在发生时抢救资金。",
   "spoken": "SEAL 的白帽安全港框架，让协议通过治理事先授权白帽，在攻击正在发生时抢救资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 70.336,
   "dur": 7.896,
   "speechStart": 70.434,
   "speechEnd": 77.398
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "默认条款是 72 小时内把资金返回指定地址，赏金 10%，上限 100 万美元。",
   "spoken": "默认条款是 72 小时内把资金返回指定地址，赏金 10%，上限 100 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 78.452,
   "dur": 7.8,
   "speechStart": 78.55,
   "speechEnd": 85.419
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "事发时再讨论，白帽不敢动手。",
   "spoken": "事发时再讨论，白帽不敢动手。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 86.472,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 86.57,
   "speechEnd": 89.224
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "平时也要准备。",
   "spoken": "平时也要准备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 90.268,
   "dur": 1.896,
   "speechStart": 90.366,
   "speechEnd": 91.33
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "实时监控大额流出和权限变更，风控名单每日更新，每季度演练一次，确认联系人是否有效。",
   "spoken": "实时监控大额流出和权限变更，风控名单每日更新，每季度演练一次，确认联系人是否有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 92.384,
   "dur": 8.208,
   "speechStart": 92.482,
   "speechEnd": 99.743
  },
